# Terraform local data and state
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Local Terraform configuration may contain credentials or account details
**/backend.hcl
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
!**/backend.hcl.example

# Lock files belong to root modules, not reusable modules
*/modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
